.Dd 2025-09-30
.Dt EVP_MAC-BLAKE2 7ossl
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm EVP_MAC-BLAKE2 ,
.Nm EVP_MAC-BLAKE2BMAC ,
.Nm EVP_MAC-BLAKE2SMAC
.Nd The BLAKE2 EVP_MAC implementations
.Sh DESCRIPTION
Support for computing BLAKE2 MACs through the
.Sy EVP_MAC
API.
.Ss Identity
These implementations are identified with one of these names and
properties, to be used with
.Xr EVP_MAC_fetch 3 :
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqBLAKE2BMAC", \(dqprovider=default"
.It \(dqBLAKE2SMAC", \(dqprovider=default"
.El
.Ss Supported parameters
The general description of these parameters can be found in
.Xr EVP_MAC 3 .
.Pp
All these parameters (except for "block-size") can be set with
.Xr EVP_MAC_CTX_set_params 3 .
Furthermore, the "size" parameter can be retrieved with
.Xr EVP_MAC_CTX_get_params 3 ,
or with
.Xr EVP_MAC_CTX_get_mac_size 3 .
The length of the "size" parameter should not exceed that of a
.Sy size_t .
Likewise, the "block-size" parameter can be retrieved with
.Xr EVP_MAC_CTX_get_params 3 ,
or with
.Xr EVP_MAC_CTX_get_block_size 3 .
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It \(dqkey" ( Ns Sy OSSL_MAC_PARAM_KEY Ns ) <octet string>
Sets the MAC key.
It may be at most 64 bytes for BLAKE2BMAC or 32 for BLAKE2SMAC and at
least 1 byte in both cases.
Setting this parameter is identical to passing a
.Em key
to
.Xr EVP_MAC_init 3 .
.It \(dqcustom" ( Ns Sy OSSL_MAC_PARAM_CUSTOM Ns ) <octet string>
Sets the customization/personalization string.
It is an optional value of at most 16 bytes for BLAKE2BMAC or 8 for
BLAKE2SMAC, and is empty by default.
.It \(dqsalt" ( Ns Sy OSSL_MAC_PARAM_SALT Ns ) <octet string>
Sets the salt.
It is an optional value of at most 16 bytes for BLAKE2BMAC or 8 for
BLAKE2SMAC, and is empty by default.
.It \(dqsize" ( Ns Sy OSSL_MAC_PARAM_SIZE Ns ) <unsigned integer>
Sets the MAC size.
It can be any number between 1 and 32 for EVP_MAC_BLAKE2S or between 1
and 64 for EVP_MAC_BLAKE2B. It is 32 and 64 respectively by default.
.It \(dqblock-size" ( Ns Sy OSSL_MAC_PARAM_BLOCK_SIZE Ns ) <unsigned integer>
Gets the MAC block size.
It is 64 for EVP_MAC_BLAKE2S and 128 for EVP_MAC_BLAKE2B.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr EVP_MAC_CTX_get_params 3 ,
.Xr EVP_MAC_CTX_set_params 3 ,
.Xr EVP_MAC 3 ,
.Xr OSSL_PARAM 3
